  "formulation_assessment": "Restricted label-free calibration generalizes its accuracy-recovery effect to a convolutional/recurrent SNN and clears 70 percent for every seed. It beats logit-only in only three of five paired seeds and has a substantially looser audit bound. Labeled QAT has the strongest mean recovery when included, but its certificate is as loose as certificate-directed repair. The repair mechanism is supported, but neither objective superiority nor a tight certificate is supported. This remains development rather than sequestered evidence.",
